text = " The end is upon us! The Great Unifying Pandemic of Everything is coming any day now, and no one is prepared! Our plucky heroes, four mad scientists (Oslo, Hell-Bourg, Montreal, and Capricorn, who call themselves the 'Quasar Quantum Quaternion Qrew' - Q4) have banded together to oversee the creation of the cure to a cataclysmic pandemic which they have hypothesized... to.. uhm.. be a real thing? Don't look at them like that!

Trapped in their laboratory simulating the upcoming assault of diseases and with only one rapidly deteriorating gas mask to share between them, the group must work together to continuously build new masks to avoid death by the infectious fog that could seep into their room at any moment. Luckily, the leak only affects one room at a time because of Montreal’s ingenious air vent locks- a paranoid precaution, they all said! Well who’s laughing now? Not Q4: this is not a laughing gas."
autowrap_mode = 2

